The problems in this directory are the Maros-Meszaros convex QP test set, converted
from the MAT files of https://github.com/qpsolvers/maros_meszaros_qpbenchmark
(commit afa738d9a66aca7f5ae223034c72f2e9c6866aff, Apache License 2.0, Copyright the
qpsolvers authors), which in turn convert the original SIF problems of
I. Maros and C. Meszaros, "A repository of convex quadratic programming problems",
Optimization Methods and Software 11:671 (1999).

The reference solutions (OSQP, Clarabel, quadprog) were computed by tools/qporacle.
